<title>BELARUS: Belarus rouble edges down to 22,530 per dlr.</title>
<headline>Belarus rouble edges down to 22,530 per dlr.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belarussian rouble edged down to 22,530 per dollar on the Minsk Interbank Currency Exchange from 22,450 at the previous session.</p>
<p>					    February 19	February 18</p>
<p> Belar rouble rate to dollar	   22,530	     22,450</p>
<p> Volume traded			  $3.234 million	 $2.752 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
